      "name": "medusa",
      "status": "disabled",
      "reason": "Upstream publishes no linux/arm64 release asset (v1.5.1 ships medusa-linux-x64, medusa-mac-arm64, medusa-mac-x64 and medusa-win-x64 only), so half of our platforms would have no verified digest. The lock installs the same tool set on every architecture, so this stays disabled until upstream ships linux/arm64 or we build it from a pinned source revision."
